  "description": "Abandoned at birth, Ba-Ri is a young girl with a mind-reading aversion. Cursed by the world, she comes to believe herself a monster. Then, the monster hunter Mu Ure appears before her.\n\n *\"You are not a monster. I need you.\"*\n\nThe moment she believes those words, her destiny awakens. The path connecting the afterlife and the human world, her journey to becoming a god, begins.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
